      Synchronous example:

      ```js
      findAuthor() {
        if (Math.random() > 0.5) {
          throw new Error();
        }
        return new Author();
      }

      try {
        return findAuthor(); // succeed or fail
      } catch(error) {
        return findOtherAuther();
      } finally {
        // always runs
        // doesn't affect the return value
      }
