 * The second parameter, `axis`, is optional. It's used to orient 3D rotations
 * in WebGL mode. If a <a href="#/p5.Vector">p5.Vector</a> is passed, as in
 * `rotate(QUARTER_PI, myVector)`, then the coordinate system will rotate
