 *  @param  {String} filename name of file to be saved.
 *  @param  {String} [extension] format to use for the file.
 *  @param  {Boolean} [isCRLF] whether to add `\r\n` to the end of each
 *                             string. Defaults to `false`.
 *
 * @example
 * <div>
 * <code>
 * function setup() {
 *   createCanvas(100, 100);
