* Returns an array with the names of the element's child elements as
    * `String`s.
    *
    * @method listChildren
    * @return {String[]} names of the child elements.
    *
    * @example
    * <div>
    * <code>
    * let myXML;
    *
    * // Load the XML and create a p5.XML object.
    * function preload() {
    *   myXML = loadXML('assets/animals.xml');
